      "level": 1,
      "content": "Multiple Spaces"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "HTML collapses multiple spaces into a single space, ignoring extra spaces."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<p>This  is a   paragraph.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Browser Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "A webpage collapsing multiple spaces into a single space.",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "From the output, you can see the extra spaces are ignored by the browser."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If we need to display multiple spaces, we can use the non-breaking space entity, &nbsp;. For example,"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<p>This&nbsp;&nbsp;is a&nbsp;&nbsp;paragraph.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Browser Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "A webpage showing multiple spaces.",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This time the browser renders the extra spaces as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
